{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — My Account › Wishlist
   templates/user/wishlist.html.twig

   REBUILT onto the shared account shell — same recipe as
   help / notifications / bookings / payments / messages /
   reviews / wallet:

     - Sidebar: shared partial templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig,
       highlight key 'wishlist'. The inline <aside> + its ~110-line
       CSS block are gone (the partial owns them) — and with them
       the Saved Searches entry (removed from the sidebar
       everywhere; help is now the last entry).
     - Theme boot: swapped rhTheme/data-theme-preview -> the app key
       roomhive_theme -> html.dark + html[data-theme] (the old key
       was never written, so this page could never go dark — real
       bug, same as the help page had).
     - Dark mode CSS: every html[data-theme-preview="1"] /
       body[data-theme="dark"] pair became a single html.dark rule
       (sidebar dark rules are not on this page anymore — the
       partial owns them).
     - NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — bulletproof, notifications/
       settings variant (no ub-page-head here): the old flat
       "margin-top: 110px" rule could lose the cascade and its
       margin could collapse — now main.up-dashboard (higher
       specificity, always wins) carries the clearance as PADDING:
       110px 20px 70px, max-width: 1560px; .up-dashboard
       .up-content { padding-top: 75px; } puts the wishlist card on
       the 185px card line; .up-dashboard .up-sidebar sticks at
       the 110px line (the partial's default is 86px).
     - Navbar include: defensive ?? guards added — controller
       variable NAMES kept, with fallbacks for the other render
       contract (user.avatar_path / notif_count) so the bell and
       avatar work either way.
     - Already modern here, kept as-is: guarded lucide loader
       (__rhNavbarLucide), partials/footer.html.twig, collapse
       script (updateTitles), real reveal + 1.5s failsafe, and the
       client-side remove-from-wishlist flow.

   Content (1:1 — nothing content-side changed):
   - wishlist card: live count (upWlCount), Browse Listings link
   - 3-col grid of saved listings: cover photo (gradient
     placeholder + onerror->remove), heart remove button
     (up-wl-heart, busy state), title, map-pin location,
     ₱ price / night; rows open nothing here — removal is the
     only action (toggle endpoint saved:false = removed)
   - empty state (upWlEmpty): Nothing saved yet → BROWSE LISTINGS

   Data from the wishlist controller (wishlist / count aliases,
   wl_total via template usage; user, notif_count on the
   additions contract). Controller untouched — template-only
   change. Pure Twig -> Ctrl+F5.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>My Wishlist · RoomHive</title>

        <script>
            /* theme boot — before paint (app key: roomhive_theme) */
            (function () {
                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem("roomhive_theme") === "dark") {
                        document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
                        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", "dark");
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            })();
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/myaccount.css') }}">

        <style>
            :root {
                --rh-ink: #1c2a38;
                --rh-muted: #66788a;
                --rh-line: #e6ebf1;
                --rh-card: #ffffff;
                --rh-accent: #eda423;
                --rh-accent-deep: #d98c12;
                --rh-radius: 16px;
            }

            body {
                background: #f3f5f9;
            }

            .up-dashboard,
            .up-dashboard * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                       NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof
                                       (no ub-page-head here — notifications/settings variant).
                                       main.up-dashboard (higher specificity, always wins vs
                                       myaccount.css) carries the clearance as PADDING —
                                       margins can collapse, padding can never: padding:
                                       110px 20px 70px, max-width: 1560px. The wishlist card
                                       joins the 185px card line via the 75px content drop.
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard {
                margin-top: 0;
                padding: 110px 20px 70px;
                max-width: 1560px;
            }

            /* the content column keeps its extra 75px drop below the
                                       shell's 110px clearance (the wishlist card lands on the
                                       same 185px line as the other account pages) */
            .up-dashboard .up-content {
                padding-top: 75px;
            }

            /* sticky offset matches the shell's clearance line — when
                                       you scroll, the sidebar sticks at the same 110px line
                                       instead of tucking under the navbar (the partial's
                                       default is 86px) */
            .up-dashboard .up-sidebar {
                top: 110px;
            }

            /* sidebar markup + styles live in templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig */

            .nav-bell svg {
                width: 22px;
                height: 22px;
                display: block;
            }

            /* ================= wishlist card + grid ================= */
            .up-wishlist-card {
                background: #fff;
                border: 1px solid #e6ebf1;
                border-radius: 16px;
                padding: 20px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.05);
            }
            .up-card-header {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 10px;
                margin-bottom: 16px;
            }
            .up-card-header h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 17px;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }
            .up-card-header a {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #2f7de1;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            .up-card-header a:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }

            .up-wl-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
                gap: 16px;
            }
            .listing-box {
                background: #fff;
                border: 1px solid #e6ebf1;
                border-radius: 14px;
                padding: 10px;
                transition:
                    transform 0.2s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.2s ease;
                position: relative; /* heart button's offset parent */
            }
            .listing-box:hover {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.1);
            }
            /* card link — wraps photo + info so the whole card is
                                       clickable to the listing detail page. Neutral styling
                                       so it never turns blue/underlined. */
            .up-wl-card-link {
                display: block;
                text-decoration: none;
                color: inherit;
            }
            .up-wl-photo {
                position: relative;
                height: 150px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                overflow: hidden;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6ee, #c9d4e0);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                color: #93a5b7;
            }
            .up-wl-photo > svg {
                width: 26px;
                height: 26px;
            }
            .up-wl-photo img {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
                transition: transform 0.35s ease;
            }
            .listing-box:hover .up-wl-photo img {
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
            .up-wl-heart {
                position: absolute;
                top: 10px;
                right: 10px;
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                border: 0;
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.22);
                transition: transform 0.2s ease;
                z-index: 2;
            }
            .up-wl-heart svg {
                width: 17px;
                height: 17px;
                color: #e5484d;
                fill: #e5484d;
            }
            .up-wl-heart:hover {
                transform: scale(1.1);
            }
            .up-wl-heart.busy {
                opacity: 0.5;
                pointer-events: none;
            }
            .up-wl-info {
                padding: 10px 4px 2px;
            }
            .up-wl-info h4 {
                margin: 0 0 3px;
                font-size: 14.5px;
                color: #1c2a38;
                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
            }
            .up-wl-loc {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 5px;
                margin: 0 0 6px;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: #66788a;
            }
            .up-wl-loc svg {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-wl-price {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
                color: #66788a;
            }
            .up-wl-price strong {
                color: #1c2a38;
                font-size: 15px;
            }
            .up-wl-empty {
                margin-top: 6px;
            }

            /* ================= dark mode (html.dark — same mechanism
                                       as the other account pages; the old data-theme-preview /
                                       body[data-theme] pairs never fired) ================= */
            html.dark .up-wishlist-card {
                background: #1e2a38;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            }
            html.dark .up-card-header h3 {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .listing-box {
                background: #243140;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
            }
            html.dark .up-wl-photo {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #26333f, #1c2a38);
                color: #5f7488;
            }
            html.dark .up-wl-info h4 {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .up-wl-loc,
            html.dark .up-wl-price {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .up-wl-price strong {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }

            /* ================= responsive =================
                                       (860px sidebar rules live in the shared partial) */
            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                .up-wl-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 560px) {
                .up-wl-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
            }
            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .listing-box,
                .up-wl-photo img {
                    transition: none;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: nav_avatar ?? user.avatar_path ?? null,
            notification_count: notification_count ?? notif_count ?? 0,
            current_page: 'wishlist'
        }) }}

        <main class="up-dashboard">

            <!-- ==================================================
                 SIDEBAR — shared partial (templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig)
                 highlight = active_sidebar key · collapse JS stays on this page
            =================================================== -->
            {% include 'partials/sidebar.html.twig' with { active_sidebar: 'wishlist' } %}

            <div class="up-content">

                <section class="up-wishlist-card up-reveal">

                    <div class="up-card-header">
                        <h3>My Wishlist (<span class="up-wishlist-count" id="upWlCount">{{ wl_total }}</span>)</h3>
                        <a href="/" class="up-link-view-all">Browse Listings</a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-wl-grid" id="upWlGrid">
                        {% for w in wishlist %}
                            <article
                                class="listing-box up-reveal"
                                data-listing-id="{{ w.id }}"
                                style="--i: {{ min(loop.index0, 6) }}; border-radius: 14px;"
                            >
                                <a href="{{ path('app_listing_detail', { id: w.id }) }}" class="up-wl-card-link">
                                    <div class="up-wl-photo">
                                        {% if w.cover_url|default('') %}
                                            <img
                                                src="{{ w.cover_url }}"
                                                alt="{{ w.title }}"
                                                onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/ListingPlaceholder.png';"
                                            >
                                        {% else %}
                                            <img src="/images/ListingPlaceholder.png" alt="{{ w.title }}" style="opacity:0.35;">
                                        {% endif %}
                                        <i data-lucide="home"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="up-wl-info">
                                        <h4>{{ w.title }}</h4>
                                        <p class="up-wl-loc"><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>{{ w.location }}</p>
                                        <p class="up-wl-price"><strong>&#8369;{{ w.price_str|default('0') }}</strong><span> / night</span></p>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                                <button type="button" class="up-wl-heart" aria-label="Remove from wishlist">
                                    <i data-lucide="heart"></i>
                                </button>
                            </article>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-bookings-empty up-wl-empty" id="upWlEmpty" {% if wishlist %}style="display:none"{% endif %}>
                        <i data-lucide="heart"></i>
                        <p class="up-bookings-empty-title">Nothing saved yet</p>
                        <p class="up-bookings-empty-text">
                            Tap the heart on any listing and it will be waiting for you here.
                        </p>
                        <a href="/" class="up-btn-outline">BROWSE LISTINGS</a>
                    </div>

                </section>

            </div>
        </main>

        {{ include('partials/footer.html.twig') }}

        <!-- Lucide — guarded loader, same key as navbar (never double-runs) -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";
                function renderRhIcons() {
                    if (window.lucide && typeof window.lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                        window.lucide.createIcons();
                    }
                }
                if (!window.__rhNavbarLucide) {
                    window.__rhNavbarLucide = true;
                    var s = document.createElement("script");
                    s.src = "https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.469.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js";
                    s.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
                    document.head.appendChild(s);
                }
                if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", renderRhIcons);
                } else {
                    renderRhIcons();
                }
                window.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Sidebar collapse — same behavior + localStorage key -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                var sidebar = document.getElementById("upSidebar");
                var toggle = document.getElementById("upSidebarToggle");
                if (!sidebar || !toggle) {
                    return;
                }

                var STORAGE_KEY = "roomhive_sidebar_collapsed";
                var links = sidebar.querySelectorAll(".up-side-link");

                function updateTitles(collapsed) {
                    links.forEach(function (link) {
                        var label = link.querySelector(".up-side-label");
                        if (collapsed) {
                            link.setAttribute("title", label ? label.textContent : "");
                        } else {
                            link.removeAttribute("title");
                        }
                    });
                }

                function applyState(collapsed) {
                    sidebar.classList.toggle("collapsed", collapsed);
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", collapsed ? "false" : "true");
                    toggle.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        collapsed ? "Expand sidebar" : "Collapse sidebar",
                    );
                    updateTitles(collapsed);
                }

                var savedCollapsed = false;
                try {
                    savedCollapsed = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) === "1";
                } catch (e) {}
                applyState(savedCollapsed);

                toggle.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var nowCollapsed = !sidebar.classList.contains("collapsed");
                    applyState(nowCollapsed);
                    try {
                        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, nowCollapsed ? "1" : "0");
                    } catch (e) {}
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Reveal — real legacy mechanism (.in-view) + 1.5s failsafe -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
                var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(
                    document.querySelectorAll(".up-reveal"),
                );

                function showAll() {
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        el.classList.add("in-view");
                    });
                }

                if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
                    showAll();
                } else {
                    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
                        function (entries) {
                            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                                if (!entry.isIntersecting) {
                                    return;
                                }
                                var el = entry.target;
                                io.unobserve(el);
                                el.classList.add("in-view");
                                window.setTimeout(function () {
                                    el.style.setProperty("--i", "0");
                                }, 1200);
                            });
                        },
                        {
                            threshold: 0.12,
                            rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px",
                        },
                    );
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        io.observe(el);
                    });

                    setTimeout(showAll, 1500);
                }
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Remove from wishlist — shared toggle endpoint (saved:false = removed) -->
        <script>
            document.addEventListener(
                "click",
                function (ev) {
                    var t = ev.target;
                    if (!(t instanceof Element)) {
                        return;
                    }
                    var heart = t.closest(".up-wl-heart");
                    if (!heart) {
                        return;
                    }
                    ev.preventDefault();
                    ev.stopPropagation();

                    var box = heart.closest(".listing-box");
                    var id = box ? box.getAttribute("data-listing-id") : null;
                    if (!id) {
                        return;
                    }

                    heart.classList.add("busy");
                    fetch("/wishlist/toggle", {
                        method: "POST",
                        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" },
                        body: "listing_id=" + encodeURIComponent(id),
                    })
                        .then(function (r) {
                            return r.json();
                        })
                        .then(function (d) {
                            heart.classList.remove("busy");
                            if (!d || !d.ok) {
                                alert((d && d.error) || "Could not update your wishlist.");
                                return;
                            }
                            if (d.saved) {
                                /* ended up saved (race) — keep the card */
                                return;
                            }
                            if (box) {
                                box.remove();
                            }

                            var cnt = document.getElementById("upWlCount");
                            if (cnt) {
                                var n = parseInt(cnt.textContent, 10);
                                if (!isNaN(n) && n > 0) {
                                    cnt.textContent = n - 1;
                                }
                            }

                            var grid = document.getElementById("upWlGrid");
                            if (grid && !grid.querySelector(".listing-box")) {
                                var empty = document.getElementById("upWlEmpty");
                                if (empty) {
                                    empty.style.display = "";
                                }
                            }
                        })
                        .catch(function () {
                            heart.classList.remove("busy");
                            alert("Network error — try again.");
                        });
                },
                true,
            );
        </script>

    </body>
</html>
